         the outside both look exactly like an optimiser that made a different call. The refusal
         REASONS are the product here, not a nicety, so they are asserted. GearOptimizer itself reads
         Main.Character and cannot compile here; the decision — which id takes which slot, and what
         gets said about the ones that can't — is Unity-free by construction. -->
    <Compile Include="..\..\NGUAdvisor\Managers\GearLock.cs" Link="Linked\GearLock.cs" />
